{
  "about": "The XML tokenizer's tokens, each [kind, start, end]: lt, lt_slash, gt, slash_gt, eq, name, attr_value (inside its quotes), char_data (entities left as written), cdata (inside its markers) and eof. Comments, processing instructions and a DOCTYPE without an internal subset are skipped. A refusal is its error and the offset the tokenizer stopped at.",
